acy of sildenafil as adjuvant therapy to selective serotonin reuptake inhibitor in alleviating premature ejaculation</article-title><source>Urology</source><year>2003</year><volume>61</volume><fpage>197</fpage><lpage>200</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12559295</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Choi</surname><given-names>HK</given-names></name><name><surname>Jung</surname><given-names>GW</given-names></name><name><surname>Moon</surname><given-names>KH</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><article-title>Clinical study of SS-cream in patients with lifelong premature ejaculation</article-title><source>Urology</source><year>2000</year><volume>55</volume><fpage>257</fpage><lpage>61</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10688090</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b15"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Coffey</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name></person-group><source>Androgen action and the sex accessory tissues</source><year>1988</year><publisher-loc>New York</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Raven Press</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="b16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dixon</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name><name><surname>Jen</surname><given-names>PY</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Development of nerves containing nitric oxide synthase in the human male urogenital organs</article-title><source>Br J Urol</source><year>1995</year><volume>76</volume><fpage>719</fpage><lpage>25</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8535715</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Djoseland</surname><given-names>O</given-names></name><name><surname>Gordeladze</surname><given-names>JO</given-names></name><name><surname>Hoglo</surname><given-names>S</given-name